"[{\"cycle\":\"30\",\"text\":\"2\\n6\\n1\\n30\\n1 - 2\\nFull amount\\n3 - 6\\nProrate amount\\n7 - 30\\nCharge full for next billing cycle\\nActive segments split the billing cycle between them; disabling a segment lets the remaining ones cover its days. Cycles align to calendar boundaries (months start on the 1st, weeks on the store's start-of-week day, years on January 1) and extra calendar days go to the last active segment. Not available together with Different Renewal Price, a trial, or lifetime periods. Supported for manual payment gateways, Stripe, and Mollie.\"}]"
